WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.907 --> 00:00:03.462
YING NAN
You are a product

00:00:04.188 --> 00:00:06.227
of all who
came before you.

00:00:11.922 --> 00:00:13.388
SHANG-CHI
I've lived in the shadows.

00:00:15.068 --> 00:00:17.976
But now,
it's time to show them...

00:00:18.881 --> 00:00:19.895
...who I really am.

00:00:22.764 --> 00:00:23.732
I'm ready.

